      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "At least at the moment, tab seems to behave normally when in first person. So only Scroll wheel and F5 are broken for world creators (which is also horrible).\n\nI haven't tested it, but I assume it would have also broken my mouse emulation otherwise.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3sW0ur2Shgg",
